	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Literas pietatis tuae hodie per huncce vestrum accepimus <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>et statim eas, quae d. <persName ref="p8063">St[eigero]</persName> debebantur, misi illi in senatum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>et illum horum quoque submonui, quae in meis continebantur.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Is senatui ea, quae ipsi visa sunt proposuit.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Senatus ad <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>vestros scribit rursus; non autem videtur nostris consultum esse, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ut urbes in Aroviam convocentur, sed ut communis ille con<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ventus indictus expectetur, legatis autem nihil aliud committatur, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>nisi ut audiant et, quae audierint, ad suos referant.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Inde <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>alia comitia fore indicenda et rem protrahendam aliquousque; <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>interea multa alia posse cognosci, quę fortassis adhuc sunt <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>incognita.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quid illi proposituri sint, heri ad te per alium <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>cursorem, qui <placeName ref="l167">Geneva</placeName> redit, perscripsi.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Monet autem dominus consul, ut <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>saltem apud <persName>Scaphusianos</persName> efficiatis, ut hoc idem respondeant; <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>nostros apud <placeName ref="l28">Basilienses</placeName> effecturos, ut eiusdem sint sententię.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Interea se parant nostri accurate, qua de re ad fratrem <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>paucula scripsi, quę tamen non nollem omnibus esse nota.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Si modo accederet resipiscentia maior et preces ardentiores, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>bene adhuc sperarem de bonitate domini.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">In <placeName>Gallia</placeName> audimus <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>inter nobilitatem magnas esse simultates et odia, etiam inter <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>papistas.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quid si <persName ref="p19788">Abimelech</persName> et Sichimitae contra se ipsos <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>commoverentur?</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Cum <persName ref="p8033">Beza</persName> nihil adhuc agendum esse censeo, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ne ille bonis viris, a quibus haec habeo, noceat; nocet etiam ille <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>sibi et suis plurimum his sermonibus, ut nostri ad contr[ibuendum] <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>multo sint difficiliores.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">De reliquis scripsi heri et [alia] <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>quaedam hodie ad fratrem.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te vicissim am[ici et] <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>fratres omnes, praesertim <persName ref="p8063">Steigerus</persName>, cuius quasi hac in [re] <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ad te sum amanuensis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> 21. novembris 157[2].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/><persName ref="p8018">I[ohannes] H[allerus</persName>], totus tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Scriptum ex bulla iu<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>bilaei excerptum remitto; habemus enim <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>ipsius exemplar integrum<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Lieber herr gfatter, ich schick üch hie dise orhennen oder <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>berghuͦn zum guͦten jar.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">Ich sölt mich wol in vil wäg <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>danckbar gegen üch erzeigen; so weiß ich nitt womitt.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z35"/>Ir wellind uff dißmal also verguͦt han.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de">Dem h[erren] <persName ref="p8063">St[eiger]</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>ist sin wyn noch nitt kon; ich hoff, er werd aber das best thuͦn; <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>darzuͦ wil ich helffen, als vast ich mag.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de" ana="salute">Gruͤßend mir <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>den alten m. <placeName>Trüben</placeName> und sinen sun, üweren tochterman, <lb xml:id="p1z39"/><foreign xml:lang="la">et reliquos tuos omnes</foreign>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>fidelissimo pastori, domino suo <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>honorando et compatri charis<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>simo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/>M. <persName ref="p495">Heinrych Bullinger</persName><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>n zuͦ <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
